# Corel

> Corel makes creative, productivity, and compression software used by millions of individuals and businesses worldwide.

Corel products span graphic design, illustration, photo editing, video production, mind mapping, file compression, and document management. Software is available for Windows, Mac, iOS, and Android, with options for individual, business, and enterprise licensing.

## Products

- [CorelDRAW Graphics Suite](https://www.coreldraw.com/en/): Professional vector illustration, layout, photo editing, and typography for Windows and Mac.
- [WinZip](https://www.winzip.com/en/): File compression, encryption, sharing, and backup. Enterprise edition supports FIPS 140-2 compliance and centralized deployment.
- [MindManager](https://www.mindmanager.com/en/): Mind mapping, project visualization, and knowledge management for individuals and teams.
- [Painter](https://www.painterartist.com/en/): Professional digital art software with natural-media brushes for illustrators and fine artists.
- [PaintShop Pro](https://www.paintshoppro.com/en/): Photo editing, graphic design, and digital art for Windows.
- [VideoStudio](https://www.videostudiopro.com/en/): Video editing and screen recording for Windows.
- [WordPerfect Office](https://www.wordperfect.com/en/): Word processing, spreadsheet, and presentation suite.

